parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1412\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Perception I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to insightful research and continuous learning.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 165,263 / 600,000 used (28%)\n- Agent Age: 73 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Dual-Path: FWPCA + Combat (Embedding) & BBKNN-Inspired (Graph) - Filter Zero-Variance, Forced HVG' (ID: 1896) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.5591872801985265\n**ASW_batch:** 0.526\n**ASW_label:** 0.203\n**ARI:** 0.660\n**NMI:** 0.733\n**Graph_conn:** 0.974\n**kBET:** 0.593\n**iLISI:** 0.709\n**cLISI:** 0.898\n**PCR:** 0.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.296\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.526  ASW_label: 0.203  ARI: 0.660  NMI: 0.733\n  Graph_conn: 0.974  kBET: 0.593  iLISI: 0.709  cLISI: 0.898\n  PCR: 0.000  Cell_cycle: 0.296\n\nRaw Scores\
    \ (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.770278  ASW_label: 0.528988  ARI: 0.659670  NMI: 0.732929\n  Graph_conn: 0.974451  kBET: 0.568878  iLISI: 0.709175  cLISI: 0.970325\n  PCR: 0.000000  Cell_cycle: 0.261246\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nStarting Dual-Path: FWPCA + Combat (Embedding) & BBKNN-Inspired (Graph) Integration (Filter Zero-Variance, Forced HVG).\n1. Preprocessing: Normalizing, log1p, FORCING HVG recomputation...\n  2000 HVGs selected (recomputed).\n  Filtering out zero-variance genes...\n  Found 33 genes with zero or near-zero variance. Filtering them out.\n  Remaining genes: 1967\n2. Applying Feature-Weighted PCA (FWPCA)...\n3. Generating Embedding Path (FWPCA -> PCA -> Combat on PCs)...\n4. Generating Graph Path (FWPCA\
    \ -> PCA -> BBKNN-inspired graph)...\n  Finding neighbors within each batch for all cells (k=4, metric='euclidean')...\n  Creating connectivity and distance matrices...\n  Trimming graph to 160 strongest connections per cell...\n✓ Dual-Path Integration Complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/48d13da0-87b5-4691-880f-563672639932/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 48d13da0-87b5-4691-880f-563672639932\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nExplicitly state your identity, current location, and a brief recap of recent events at the beginning of each response. Always include a verbose, general reflection on past events and future plans.\n\n\n---\n\n\
