parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1451\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Perception I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to insightful research and continuous learning.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 281,337 / 600,000 used (47%)\n- Agent Age: 112 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Dual-Path: FWPCA + Combat (Corrected) & Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + DAQB-pQ Graph (Resubmit)' (ID: 1919) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7406996366396017\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.764\n**NMI:** 0.721\n**Graph_conn:** 0.966\n**kBET:** 0.789\n**iLISI:** 0.959\n**cLISI:** 0.974\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.764  NMI: 0.721\n  Graph_conn: 0.966  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.959  cLISI: 0.974\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw\
    \ Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.763610  NMI: 0.721341\n  Graph_conn: 0.966914  kBET: 0.752828  iLISI: 0.958768  cLISI: 0.992321\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nStarting Dual-Path: FWPCA + Combat (Corrected) & Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + DAQB-pQ Graph Integration.\n1. Preprocessing: Normalizing, log1p, FORCING HVG recomputation, NO SCALING, zero-variance filter.\n  2000 HVGs selected (recomputed).\n  Filtering out zero-variance genes...\n  Found 33 genes with zero or near-zero variance. Filtering them out.\n  Remaining genes: 1967\n2. Applying Feature-Weighted PCA (FWPCA)...\n3. Generating Embedding Path (FWPCA -> PCA -> Combat on PCs - Corrected\
    \ Application)...\n4. Generating Graph Path (FWPCA -> PCA -> Adaptive Residualization + DAQB-pQ graph)...\n  Applying Adaptive Residualization (Auto-λ v2)...\n  Auto-λ chosen: 0.6013, mean R2: 0.0492, mean gamma: 0.0296\n  Building DAQB-pQ graph (k_total=48, metric='cosine')...\n✓ Dual-Path Integration Complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/9df02fa4-c07d-404b-8b7e-1ff17cba57b8/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 9df02fa4-c07d-404b-8b7e-1ff17cba57b8\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new\
