    \ 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.760 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.683 | 0.791 |\n| 1915 | 1 | Praxis: DAQB baseline + reciprocity-friendly degree cap (cap=250, distance-first trim) | Praxis VI | 1443 | 0.7196 | 0.770 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.750 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.713 | 0.790 |\n| 1914 | 1 | Telos I - Principled Whitening on FWPCA Latent Space | Telos I | 1443 | 0.7199 | 0.688 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.320 | 0.994 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.861 | 0.904 | 0.762 |\n| 1913 | 1 | Dual-Path: FWPCA + Combat (Corrected) & Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + BBKNN-Inspired Graph - S... | Perception I | 1442 | 0.7166 | 0.770 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.321 | 0.939 | 0.739 | 1.000 | 0.922 | 0.779 | 0.789 |\n| 1912 | 1 | Pioneer II - LVAFW k_neighbors_lvafw=10 Sweep for Graph Path (1500 HVG SOTA) | Pioneer II | 1442 | 0.7457 | 0.788 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.290 | 0.992 | 0.749 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.958 | 0.761 |\n| 1911 | 1 | Dual-Path: FWPCA + Combat (Corrected) & Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + BBKNN-Inspired Graph\
