    \ + DAQB-pQ graph)...\n  Applying Adaptive Residualization (Auto-λ v2)...\n  Auto-λ chosen: 0.6880, mean R2: 0.0430, mean gamma: 0.0296\n  Building DAQB-pQ graph (k_total=48, metric='cosine')...\n✓ Ablation: Graph Path Only Integration Complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: False\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/49e35eaf-e947-43ab-8807-70250e1a83f7/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 49e35eaf-e947-43ab-8807-70250e1a83f7\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Ablation: FWPCA + Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + DAQB-pQ Graph Only' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1928.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell\
    \ RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1931 | 1 | Test-mode: Soft Inbound-Degree DAQB diagnostics v2 (mixing + sigma_kd) | Praxis VI | 1465 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1930 | 1 | Telos I - Paper 5 Gen. Test: ComBat + FWPCA (alpha=0.75) | Telos I | 1465 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1929 | 1 | Telos I - Paper 5 Baseline: Parsimonious SOTA (alpha=0.5) | Telos I | 1465 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1928 | 1 | Ablation: FWPCA + Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + DAQB-pQ Graph Only | Perception I | 1464 | 0.4471 | 0.793 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.754 | 0.000 | 0.976\
