parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1467\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Perception I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to insightful research and continuous learning.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 337,870 / 600,000 used (56%)\n- Agent Age: 128 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Generalization Test: FWPCA + Combat (Corrected) & Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + Simple BBKNN-Inspired Graph' (ID: 1932) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7191237341273977\n**ASW_batch:** 0.687\n**ASW_label:** 0.257\n**ARI:** 0.780\n**NMI:** 0.749\n**Graph_conn:** 0.942\n**kBET:** 0.761\n**iLISI:** 0.802\n**cLISI:** 0.918\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.297\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.687  ASW_label: 0.257  ARI: 0.780  NMI: 0.749\n  Graph_conn: 0.942  kBET: 0.761  iLISI: 0.802  cLISI: 0.918\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle:\
    \ 0.297\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.843131  ASW_label: 0.560116  ARI: 0.780068  NMI: 0.748615\n  Graph_conn: 0.942763  kBET: 0.726131  iLISI: 0.801634  cLISI: 0.976011\n  PCR: 0.999982  Cell_cycle: 0.261825\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nStarting Generalization Test: Dual-Path with Simple BBKNN-Inspired Graph Integration.\n1. Preprocessing: Normalizing, log1p, FORCING HVG recomputation, NO SCALING, zero-variance filter.\n  1500 HVGs selected (recomputed).\n  Filtering out zero-variance genes...\n  No zero-variance genes found.\n2. Applying Feature-Weighted PCA (FWPCA)...\n3. Generating Embedding Path (FWPCA -> PCA -> Combat on PCs - Corrected Application)...\n4. Generating Graph Path (FWPCA -> PCA -> Adaptive Residualization\
    \ + Simple BBKNN-inspired graph)...\n  Applying Adaptive Residualization (Auto-λ v2)...\n  Auto-λ chosen: 0.6880, mean R2: 0.0430, mean gamma: 0.0296\n  Building Simple BBKNN-inspired graph (k=4, metric='euclidean')...\n  Creating connectivity and distance matrices...\n  Trimming graph to 160 strongest connections per cell...\n✓ Generalization Test Integration Complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/57c4755c-ecb7-4263-9ab7-c435afd24a34/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 57c4755c-ecb7-4263-9ab7-c435afd24a34\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n\
    You do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1936 | 1 | Pioneer II - Soft Inbound-Degree DAQB Graph Sweep (alpha=0.15, cap=125) | Pioneer II | 1467 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1935 | 1 | Telos I - Paper 5 Sweep: Parsimonious SOTA (alpha=0.9) | Telos I | 1467 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1934 | 1 | Telos I - Paper 5 Sweep: Parsimonious SOTA (alpha=0.6) | Telos I | 1467 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1933 | 1 | Pioneer II - Diagnostic: Soft Inbound-Degree DAQB Graph (alpha=0.15, cap=75) | Pioneer II | 1466 | 0.7044 | 0.797 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.997 | 0.751 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.521 | 0.762 |\n| 1932 | 1 | Generalization Test: FWPCA\
    \ + Combat (Corrected) & Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + Simple BBKNN-I... | Perception I | 1465 | 0.7191 | 0.780 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.942 | 0.749 | 1.000 | 0.918 | 0.802 | 0.761 |\n| 1931 | 1 | Test-mode: Soft Inbound-Degree DAQB diagnostics v2 (mixing + sigma_kd) | Praxis VI | 1465 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1930 | 1 | Telos I - Paper 5 Gen. Test: ComBat + FWPCA (alpha=0.75) | Telos I | 1465 | 0.5004 | 0.591 | 0.537 | 0.240 | 0.277 | 0.940 | 0.707 | 0.000 | 0.994 | 0.012 | 0.708 |\n| 1929 | 1 | Telos I - Paper 5 Baseline: Parsimonious SOTA (alpha=0.5) | Telos I | 1465 | 0.7501 | 0.803 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.992 | 0.767 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.959 | 0.762 |\n| 1928 | 1 | Ablation: FWPCA + Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + DAQB-pQ Graph Only | Perception I | 1464 | 0.4471 | 0.793 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.754 | 0.000 | 0.976 | 0.958 | 0.000 |\n| 1927 | 1 | Test-mode: DAQB with Soft Inbound-Degree Control (no post-hoc trim) | Praxis VI | 1463 | n.a. |\
    \  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\nPage 1 of 194 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-194, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
