    | 1934 | 1 | Telos I - Paper 5 Sweep: Parsimonious SOTA (alpha=0.6) | Telos I | 1467 | 0.7523 | 0.809 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.317 | 0.991 | 0.765 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.959 | 0.760 |


