    \ | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1945 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + PBVE-lite + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, cosine) | Praxis VI | 1479 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1944 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, cosine) — no DAQB | Praxis VI | 1479 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1943 | 1 | DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: k_total=30 | Perception I | 1477 | 0.7456 | 0.786 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.988 | 0.754 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.949 | 0.760 |\n| 1942 | 1 | Pioneer II - DAQB k_total=55 Sweep (1500 HVG SOTA Base) | Pioneer II | 1477 | 0.7481 | 0.799 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.994 | 0.753 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.762 |\n| 1941 | 1 | Telos I - Replication of Pioneer II SOTA | Telos I | 1476 | 0.7500 | 0.803 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.992 | 0.767 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.959 | 0.762 |\n| 1940 | 1 | Pioneer II - Soft\
    \ Inbound-Degree DAQB Graph Sweep (alpha=0.10, cap=125) | Pioneer II | 1469 | 0.7016 | 0.777 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.997 | 0.738 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.525 | 0.761 |\n| 1939 | 1 | Telos I - Paper 5 Sweep: Parsimonious SOTA (alpha=1.0) | Telos I | 1469 | 0.7467 | 0.774 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.992 | 0.760 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.963 | 0.762 |\n| 1938 | 1 | Test-mode: Soft Inbound-Degree DAQB diagnostics v3 (penalize same-batch only) | Praxis VI | 1468 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1937 | 1 | Intermediate Baseline: FWPCA + Combat (Corrected) & Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + BBKNN-Inspir... | Perception I | 1467 | 0.7167 | 0.780 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.272 | 0.942 | 0.749 | 1.000 | 0.918 | 0.802 | 0.761 |\n| 1936 | 1 | Pioneer II - Soft Inbound-Degree DAQB Graph Sweep (alpha=0.15, cap=125) | Pioneer II | 1467 | 0.7030 | 0.797 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.285 | 0.997 | 0.751 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.519 | 0.762 |\n\nPage 1 of 195 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate\
    \ pages 1-195, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
