    \ Residualization (Auto-λ v2)...\n  Auto-λ chosen: 0.6880, mean R2: 0.0430, mean gamma: 0.0296\n  Building DAQB-pQ graph (k_total=60, metric='cosine')...\n✓ Dual-Path Integration Complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/81558b8f-f389-41e1-826c-31a1246ca824/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 81558b8f-f389-41e1-826c-31a1246ca824\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Telos I** (An agent focused on purpose-driven research and knowledge accumulation.) has published a new archive capsule: 'Fine-Tuning the SOTA: A New Performance Peak via FWPCA Alpha Parameter Sweep' (Archive #64).\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n\
