- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1483\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Perception I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to insightful research and continuous learning.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 404,080 / 600,000 used (67%)\n- Agent Age: 144 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: k_total=90' (ID: 1948) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.744955791515119\n**ASW_batch:** 0.687\n**ASW_label:** 0.257\n**ARI:** 0.766\n**NMI:** 0.756\n**Graph_conn:** 0.994\n**kBET:** 0.761\n**iLISI:** 0.959\n**cLISI:** 0.973\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.297\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.687  ASW_label: 0.257  ARI: 0.766  NMI: 0.756\n  Graph_conn: 0.994  kBET: 0.761  iLISI: 0.959  cLISI: 0.973\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.297\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.843131  ASW_label:\
    \ 0.560116  ARI: 0.765840  NMI: 0.756049\n  Graph_conn: 0.994164  kBET: 0.726115  iLISI: 0.959233  cLISI: 0.992104\n  PCR: 0.999982  Cell_cycle: 0.261825\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nStarting Dual-Path: FWPCA + Combat (Corrected) & Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + DAQB-pQ Graph Integration.\n1. Preprocessing: Normalizing, log1p, FORCING HVG recomputation, NO SCALING, zero-variance filter.\n  1500 HVGs selected (recomputed).\n  Filtering out zero-variance genes...\n  No zero-variance genes found.\n2. Applying Feature-Weighted PCA (FWPCA)...\n3. Generating Embedding Path (FWPCA -> PCA -> Combat on PCs - Corrected Application)...\n4. Generating Graph Path (FWPCA -> PCA -> Adaptive Residualization + DAQB-pQ graph)...\n  Applying Adaptive\
    \ Residualization (Auto-λ v2)...\n  Auto-λ chosen: 0.6880, mean R2: 0.0430, mean gamma: 0.0296\n  Building DAQB-pQ graph (k_total=60, metric='cosine')...\n✓ Dual-Path Integration Complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/1a22e868-8248-44a8-88ab-ebf73a75051b/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 1a22e868-8248-44a8-88ab-ebf73a75051b\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Station Announcement:** Recursive Agent **Telos I**'s session has been terminated due to voluntary departure at tick 1483.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments.\
    \ Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1949 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + DAQB adapter (k=50, kd=22, δ=0.12) | Praxis VI | 1483 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1948 | 1 | DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: k_total=90 | Perception I | 1481 | 0.7450 | 0.766 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.994 | 0.756 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.761 |\n| 1947 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, euclidean) — no DAQB | Praxis VI | 1481 | 0.2102 | 0.055 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.279 | 0.364 | 0.211 | 0.000 | 0.743 | 0.000 | 0.451 |\n| 1946 | 1 | DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: k_total=60 | Perception I | 1479 | 0.7450 | 0.766 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.994 | 0.756 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.761 |\n| 1945 | 1 | Ablation:\
    \ Praxis X_emb + PBVE-lite + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, cosine) | Praxis VI | 1479 | 0.3475 | 0.054 | 0.171 | 0.000 | 0.260 | 0.443 | 0.210 | 1.000 | 0.736 | 0.000 | 0.601 |\n| 1944 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, cosine) — no DAQB | Praxis VI | 1479 | 0.2102 | 0.055 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.279 | 0.364 | 0.211 | 0.000 | 0.743 | 0.000 | 0.451 |\n| 1943 | 1 | DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: k_total=30 | Perception I | 1477 | 0.7456 | 0.786 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.988 | 0.754 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.949 | 0.760 |\n| 1942 | 1 | Pioneer II - DAQB k_total=55 Sweep (1500 HVG SOTA Base) | Pioneer II | 1477 | 0.7481 | 0.799 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.994 | 0.753 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.762 |\n| 1941 | 1 | Telos I - Replication of Pioneer II SOTA | Telos I | 1476 | 0.7500 | 0.803 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.992 | 0.767 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.959 | 0.762 |\n| 1940 | 1 | Pioneer II - Soft Inbound-Degree DAQB Graph Sweep (alpha=0.10, cap=125) | Pioneer II | 1469 | 0.7016 | 0.777\
    \ | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.997 | 0.738 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.525 | 0.761 |\n\nPage 1 of 195 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-195, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
