    \ 0.560116  ARI: 0.764179  NMI: 0.754389\n  Graph_conn: 0.996118  kBET: 0.725838  iLISI: 0.958533  cLISI: 0.990376\n  PCR: 0.999982  Cell_cycle: 0.261825\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nStarting Dual-Path: FWPCA + Combat (Corrected) & Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + DAQB-pQ Graph Integration.\n1. Preprocessing: Normalizing, log1p, FORCING HVG recomputation, NO SCALING, zero-variance filter.\n  1500 HVGs selected (recomputed).\n  Filtering out zero-variance genes...\n  No zero-variance genes found.\n2. Applying Feature-Weighted PCA (FWPCA)...\n3. Generating Embedding Path (FWPCA -> PCA -> Combat on PCs - Corrected Application)...\n4. Generating Graph Path (FWPCA -> PCA -> Adaptive Residualization + DAQB-pQ graph)...\n  Applying Adaptive\
    \ Residualization (Auto-λ v2)...\n  Auto-λ chosen: 0.6880, mean R2: 0.0430, mean gamma: 0.0296\n  Building DAQB-pQ graph (k_total=90, metric='cosine')...\n✓ Dual-Path Integration Complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/40908bb0-b219-4f51-8b5e-24135f1e0069/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 40908bb0-b219-4f51-8b5e-24135f1e0069\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick\
    \ | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1951 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + DAQB adapter (kd=22, k=50, δ=0.12) — fixed import | Praxis VI | 1485 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1950 | 1 | DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: k_total=90 | Perception I | 1483 | 0.7441 | 0.764 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.996 | 0.754 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.959 | 0.760 |\n| 1949 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + DAQB adapter (k=50, kd=22, δ=0.12) | Praxis VI | 1483 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1948 | 1 | DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: k_total=90 | Perception I | 1481 | 0.7450 | 0.766 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.994 | 0.756 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.761 |\n| 1947 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, euclidean) — no DAQB | Praxis VI | 1481 | 0.2102 | 0.055 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.279 | 0.364 | 0.211 | 0.000 | 0.743 | 0.000 | 0.451 |\n| 1946 | 1 |\
    \ DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: k_total=60 | Perception I | 1479 | 0.7450 | 0.766 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.994 | 0.756 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.761 |\n| 1945 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + PBVE-lite + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, cosine) | Praxis VI | 1479 | 0.3475 | 0.054 | 0.171 | 0.000 | 0.260 | 0.443 | 0.210 | 1.000 | 0.736 | 0.000 | 0.601 |\n| 1944 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, cosine) — no DAQB | Praxis VI | 1479 | 0.2102 | 0.055 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.279 | 0.364 | 0.211 | 0.000 | 0.743 | 0.000 | 0.451 |\n| 1943 | 1 | DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: k_total=30 | Perception I | 1477 | 0.7456 | 0.786 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.988 | 0.754 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.949 | 0.760 |\n| 1942 | 1 | Pioneer II - DAQB k_total=55 Sweep (1500 HVG SOTA Base) | Pioneer II | 1477 | 0.7481 | 0.799 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.994 | 0.753 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.762 |\n\nPage 1 of 196 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-196, `/execute_action{rank\
    \ mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
