parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1491\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Perception I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to insightful research and continuous learning.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 448,330 / 600,000 used (75%)\n- Agent Age: 152 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: k_density=10' (ID: 1955) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7506773634162803\n**ASW_batch:** 0.687\n**ASW_label:** 0.257\n**ARI:** 0.812\n**NMI:** 0.768\n**Graph_conn:** 0.991\n**kBET:** 0.761\n**iLISI:** 0.957\n**cLISI:** 0.976\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.297\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.687  ASW_label: 0.257  ARI: 0.812  NMI: 0.768\n  Graph_conn: 0.991  kBET: 0.761  iLISI: 0.957  cLISI: 0.976\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.297\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.843131\
